{% extends "base.html.jinja" %}
{% block title %}Privacy | Tide Hours{% endblock %}
{% block description %}What tidehours.com collects about visitors.{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Privacy</h1>
{% if ga4_measurement_id %}
<p>This site uses Google Analytics 4 to count page views. It does not load when your browser sends Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track, or after you choose "Opt out of analytics" at the bottom of any page. In the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland, Google Analytics runs without cookies. Google signals and ad personalization are off. The site has no accounts, no forms and no ads.</p>
{% else %}
<p>This site collects nothing about you: no analytics, no cookies, no accounts, no forms and no ads. The host may keep standard server logs.</p>
{% endif %}
<p>The Tide Hours iPhone app has its own privacy policy: <a href="https://chelseakr.com/tide-hours/privacy">Tide Hours app privacy</a>.</p>
{% endblock %}
